# The three files this repository owns, installed where the session looks for them. `rules` installs
# the app image itself; these are the parts of the port that have nothing to do with the image and
# everything to do with being installed — the same three the PKGBUILD's `package()` puts down.
packaging/celeste-linux.desktop        usr/share/applications
packaging/icons/celeste-linux.png      usr/share/icons/hicolor/256x256/apps
packaging/systemd/celeste-linux.service usr/lib/systemd/user
